{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You were hired to find the fortune hidden by powerful tycoon Augustus Blackrock, but... is that all he has hidden?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first person escape room game, you will advance through Blackrock Manor by solving puzzles that will test your observational and reasoning skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INVESTIGATE THE FAMILY TRAGEDY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were hired by a relative of Augustus Blackrock, whose fortune hasn't been found after more than a century since his demise. His family, as if burdened with a course, suffered all kind of tragedies that ended with the three possible heirs to the family weaponry company and the famed fortune, hidden by Augustus somewhere in his puzzle riddle mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to observe and use reason to solve the eight escape rooms that form this mansion. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND IMPORTANT OBJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some puzzles need a key piece to work, some times you will have to look for them - sometimes you will have to solve another puzzle to find them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517980?t=1740768135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/6863a