er puzzle to find them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Biri Biri"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/f5fdb1cf10434e02a9a84b7370730f56dbe2931c/header.jpg?t=1740768135","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Juan Luis Urbano Garc\u00eda","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101965,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101965/movie480.mp4?t=1740657681","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101965/movie_max.mp4?t=1740657681"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101965/9a97bb64eb1dd041708a1a56d5a2366fdd3b3214/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740657681","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101965/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740657681","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101965/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740657681"}}],"name":"Secrets of Blackrock Manor - Escape Room","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core CPU (Eg. Core i3 6100)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM (Eg. R7 260X, GT 730)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Biri Biri"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","r